(7342600, 1147488, 38032, '<td valign="top">Beautiful light and subject. The composition is nice as well. The only thing that jumps out is that it seems a bit set-up and a bit slanted clockwise. 6</td>', 'Beautiful light and subject. The composition is nice as well. The only thing that jumps out is that it seems a bit set-up and a bit slanted clockwise. 6', '2015-04-15 09:08:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7342602, 1147528, 38032, '<td valign="top">As a native Vermonter, this is nostalgic. The details are a bit posterized up close but the elements are clear and appealing.</td>', 'As a native Vermonter, this is nostalgic. The details are a bit posterized up close but the elements are clear and appealing.', '2015-04-15 09:10:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7342603, 1147537, 38032, '<td valign="top">Hard to tell what was more difficult - setting up that grass, or getting a shot of 2 people in the tub like that! =]<br/>It is a fun shot that works well. The white balance could use a bit of tweaking and some sharpness and contrast / dodge-burn could really make this a stunner.</td>', 'Hard to tell what was more difficult - setting up that grass, or getting a shot of 2 people in the tub like that! =]It is a fun shot that works well. The white balance could use a bit of tweaking and some sharpness and contrast / dodge-burn could really make this a stunner.', '2015-04-15 09:12:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7342604, 1147276, 38032, '<td valign="top">I dig it. Love to see nature outlast all else. Nice composition, color and treatment. 7</td>', 'I dig it. Love to see nature outlast all else. Nice composition, color and treatment. 7', '2015-04-15 09:13:34.000000', NULL, 1),
