(7343235, 1147390, 180366, '<td valign="top">What I like:<br/>- it''s well exposed<br/> <br/>What I don''t like<br/>- Focus is way too shallow.<br/>- I have no feeling for what the subject is suppose to be. <br/> <br/>Overall: not a stand out.</td>', 'What I like:- it''s well exposed What I don''t like- Focus is way too shallow.- I have no feeling for what the subject is suppose to be.  Overall: not a stand out.', '2015-04-17 12:37:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7343238, 1147199, 180366, '<td valign="top">What I like:<br/>- Beautiful bokeh<br/> <br/>What I don''t like:<br/>- Looks more like a lens test than anything else<br/>- Focus really isn''t strong on anything (which I think may have been the point...)<br/> <br/>Overall: would make a nice desktop wallpaper as it is a soothing shot with nothing that would really distract focus.</td>', 'What I like:- Beautiful bokeh What I don''t like:- Looks more like a lens test than anything else- Focus really isn''t strong on anything (which I think may have been the point...) Overall: would make a nice desktop wallpaper as it is a soothing shot with nothing that would really distract focus.', '2015-04-17 12:39:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7343243, 1146964, 180366, '<td valign="top">This is just a hard picture to judge. The exposure just seems off to me. I can''t tell what this is suppose to be. I can barely make out that it is a wheel barrel. <br/> <br/>I would reshoot this, and either chimp or pay very close attention to the light meter after asking: what is my subject? What am I trying to show about that subject?</td>', 'This is just a hard picture to judge. The exposure just seems off to me. I can''t tell what this is suppose to be. I can barely make out that it is a wheel barrel.  I would reshoot this, and either chimp or pay very close attention to the light meter after asking: what is my subject? What am I trying to show about that subject?', '2015-04-17 12:42:26.000000', NULL, 1),
