(7343253, 1147550, 180366, '<td valign="top">What I like:<br/>- it reminds me of "A Sunday Afternoon on the Island of La Grande Jatte"<br/>- Love love love the color and the angles<br/> <br/>What I don''t like:<br/>- not sure what was done, but it looks a bit too much like a painting rather than a photograph to me (but, my husband, looking over my shoulder, loves this effect so meh.)<br/> <br/>Overall: Love it! Great shot, great capture of the theme.</td>', 'What I like:- it reminds me of "A Sunday Afternoon on the Island of La Grande Jatte"- Love love love the color and the angles What I don''t like:- not sure what was done, but it looks a bit too much like a painting rather than a photograph to me (but, my husband, looking over my shoulder, loves this effect so meh.) Overall: Love it! Great shot, great capture of the theme.', '2015-04-17 13:03:28.000000', NULL, 1),
