(7343644, 1147249, 91783, '<td valign="top">the point of view and subject are actually rather nice. Though it feels like there is a lack of umph! after the challenge (or whenever) Play with the vibrancy/saturation of the colors. It currently feels flat and I feel if the colors were enhanced you may have had a real winner.</td>', 'the point of view and subject are actually rather nice. Though it feels like there is a lack of umph! after the challenge (or whenever) Play with the vibrancy/saturation of the colors. It currently feels flat and I feel if the colors were enhanced you may have had a real winner.', '2015-04-19 21:23:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7343645, 1147544, 91783, '<td valign="top">the contrast is too much! and the over saturation of the blue in the sky is too distracting. maybe next time try lowing the post production and focus on getting that crystal clear image. I feel this image would great improve if the editing was cleaner/more simple.</td>', 'the contrast is too much! and the over saturation of the blue in the sky is too distracting. maybe next time try lowing the post production and focus on getting that crystal clear image. I feel this image would great improve if the editing was cleaner/more simple.', '2015-04-19 21:25:08.000000', NULL, 1),
