(7344040, 1147338, 180366, '<td valign="top">What I like: <br/>- the contrast between the lower field and the upper one<br/> <br/>What I don''t like:<br/>- The trees in the midground break up the two fields and make the picture a bit busy. I also am not sure if the object between the two trees on the ground is a log or a machine?<br/> <br/>Overall: I''m basing my comments in part on the title and the fact that I like the contrast between the lower and upper field. I think the trees are distracting from this difference. If not for the title, I may not have even noticed that the lower field was mowed.</td>', 'What I like: - the contrast between the lower field and the upper one What I don''t like:- The trees in the midground break up the two fields and make the picture a bit busy. I also am not sure if the object between the two trees on the ground is a log or a machine? Overall: I''m basing my comments in part on the title and the fact that I like the contrast between the lower and upper field. I think the trees are distracting from this difference. If not for the title, I may not have even noticed that the lower field was mowed.', '2015-04-20 23:44:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7344041, 1147385, 180366, '<td valign="top">What I like: <br/>- The girls'' expressions and the angles they create<br/>- Good use of black and white<br/> <br/>What I don''t like<br/>- Busy background<br/> <br/>Overall: wish the camera angle or DoF had been adjusted to make background less distracting.</td>', 'What I like: - The girls'' expressions and the angles they create- Good use of black and white What I don''t like- Busy background Overall: wish the camera angle or DoF had been adjusted to make background less distracting.', '2015-04-20 23:45:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7344043, 1147557, 180366, '<td valign="top">What I like: <br/>- that the picture is black and white and the tractor/ other farm equip as the subject.<br/> <br/>What I don''t like: I feel like this shot could have been edited a bit different to make it pop. I''d have tried a red filter (either on the lens or in post) to really have the sky and clouds pop. I''m assuming the tractor is green so the tractor would become a bit darker as well making the wheels and writing pop more. Finally the focus is a bit soft<br/> <br/>Overall: I love the idea of this shot, but would have edited it differently and perhaps tried for  a different angle with B/W editing in mind (foreground is a bit dark.)</td>', 'What I like: - that the picture is black and white and the tractor/ other farm equip as the subject. What I don''t like: I feel like this shot could have been edited a bit different to make it pop. I''d have tried a red filter (either on the lens or in post) to really have the sky and clouds pop. I''m assuming the tractor is green so the tractor would become a bit darker as well making the wheels and writing pop more. Finally the focus is a bit soft Overall: I love the idea of this shot, but would have edited it differently and perhaps tried for  a different angle with B/W editing in mind (foreground is a bit dark.)', '2015-04-20 23:50:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7344044, 1147563, 180366, '<td valign="top">What I like: <br/>- Pose of child<br/>- The movement of the child in contrast to the wind in the grass.<br/>- The foreground and background<br/> <br/>What I don''t like<br/>- Focus on the child is a bit soft<br/> <br/>Overall: Lovely, dreamy shot. Bravo</td>', 'What I like: - Pose of child- The movement of the child in contrast to the wind in the grass.- The foreground and background What I don''t like- Focus on the child is a bit soft Overall: Lovely, dreamy shot. Bravo', '2015-04-20 23:52:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7344046, 1147276, 180366, '<td valign="top">What I like:<br/>- the architecture and contrasting styles of the buildings<br/> <br/>what I don''t like<br/>- colors too saturated<br/> <br/>overall- wish it was framed as a landscape instead of a portrait. Swapping to landscape would allow for darkening of the overall picture to bring back detail to the grass and to the sky (which is a bit light to my eyes).</td>', 'What I like:- the architecture and contrasting styles of the buildings what I don''t like- colors too saturated overall- wish it was framed as a landscape instead of a portrait. Swapping to landscape would allow for darkening of the overall picture to bring back detail to the grass and to the sky (which is a bit light to my eyes).', '2015-04-20 23:55:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7344047, 1147564, 180366, '<td valign="top">What I like<br/>- The contrast between the dying leaf and the growing green grass<br/> <br/>What I don''t like:<br/>- The focus is way way too soft for my liking; depth of field a bit too shallow, too<br/>- the brown object in the background.<br/> <br/>Overall: Neat idea, but so little is in focus it makes the whole shot seem out of focus.</td>', 'What I like- The contrast between the dying leaf and the growing green grass What I don''t like:- The focus is way way too soft for my liking; depth of field a bit too shallow, too- the brown object in the background. Overall: Neat idea, but so little is in focus it makes the whole shot seem out of focus.', '2015-04-20 23:55:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7344049, 1147442, 180366, '<td valign="top">What I like: <br/>- Your camera/ editing did a great job capturing details of the birds<br/> <br/>What I don''t like:<br/>- DOF is too shallow. In my opinion the background is fairly uniform so I would have stopped up the f/stops. That said, I''ve no idea how quickly the ducks were moving, so this may not have been possible but they look pretty settled in this shot.<br/>- the poses of the ducks are too bad, as they are both looking away from the camera<br/> <br/>Overall: Beautiful detail of the ducks but wish they were looking at the camera.</td>', 'What I like: - Your camera/ editing did a great job capturing details of the birds What I don''t like:- DOF is too shallow. In my opinion the background is fairly uniform so I would have stopped up the f/stops. That said, I''ve no idea how quickly the ducks were moving, so this may not have been possible but they look pretty settled in this shot.- the poses of the ducks are too bad, as they are both looking away from the camera Overall: Beautiful detail of the ducks but wish they were looking at the camera.', '2015-04-20 23:58:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7344050, 1147227, 180366, '<td valign="top">What I like:<br/>- Wow that picture is crisp! What a snapshot in time.<br/>- Nice, non-distracting background<br/> <br/>What I don''t like<br/>- The dog looks a bit scared of the stick secondary to the angle of their head (lots of white showing on left eye)<br/>- Looks a bit like he''s cowering and about to be hit by the stick rather than fetching it.<br/> <br/>Overall: great shot but I feel really sorry for the dog. Not sure if this was intent or not. If so: it''s done very well.</td>', 'What I like:- Wow that picture is crisp! What a snapshot in time.- Nice, non-distracting background What I don''t like- The dog looks a bit scared of the stick secondary to the angle of their head (lots of white showing on left eye)- Looks a bit like he''s cowering and about to be hit by the stick rather than fetching it. Overall: great shot but I feel really sorry for the dog. Not sure if this was intent or not. If so: it''s done very well.', '2015-04-21 00:01:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7344052, 1147553, 180366, '<td valign="top">What I like:<br/>- The colors are beautiful<br/> <br/>What I don''t like:<br/>- The tree is only half shown, it''s right side missing in the frame. <br/> <br/>Overall: I think this shot would look more complete if the whole tree was included.</td>', 'What I like:- The colors are beautiful What I don''t like:- The tree is only half shown, it''s right side missing in the frame.  Overall: I think this shot would look more complete if the whole tree was included.', '2015-04-21 00:03:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7344053, 1147528, 180366, '<td valign="top">What I like:<br/>- The framing on this is awesome! <br/> <br/>What I don''t like:<br/>- Contrast is way too high; saturation is too high and detail of the yellow flowers of the cover crop are lost and detail is blown out on the cow''s face as well.<br/> <br/>Overall: Great shot, but I''d edit it differently; tone down to allow more details to emerge.</td>', 'What I like:- The framing on this is awesome!  What I don''t like:- Contrast is way too high; saturation is too high and detail of the yellow flowers of the cover crop are lost and detail is blown out on the cow''s face as well. Overall: Great shot, but I''d edit it differently; tone down to allow more details to emerge.', '2015-04-21 00:05:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7344055, 1147488, 180366, '<td valign="top">What I like:<br/>- Beautiful light<br/>- Reminds me of the painting Christina''s World<br/> <br/>What I don''t like<br/>- It''s a bit posy for me. I, at least, don''t read books at that angle looking into the sun. But, alas, the light is so pretty you are forgiven in my book (but I still kinda wish it wasn''t quite so posy.)<br/> <br/>Overall: I want to adore this photo but the pose is a bit too contrived.</td>', 'What I like:- Beautiful light- Reminds me of the painting Christina''s World What I don''t like- It''s a bit posy for me. I, at least, don''t read books at that angle looking into the sun. But, alas, the light is so pretty you are forgiven in my book (but I still kinda wish it wasn''t quite so posy.) Overall: I want to adore this photo but the pose is a bit too contrived.', '2015-04-21 00:07:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7344056, 1147562, 180366, '<td valign="top">What I like:<br/>- Ah, a beautiful dog on a beautiful lawn. <br/>- Background and DOF are used wonderfully<br/> <br/>What I don''t like<br/>- Lighting on the dogs face. I would have tried to use a reflector to bounce some light onto the face and eliminate some of those shadows. <br/> <br/>Overall: Nice expression. Great snapshot of a beautiful Spring day.</td>', 'What I like:- Ah, a beautiful dog on a beautiful lawn. - Background and DOF are used wonderfully What I don''t like- Lighting on the dogs face. I would have tried to use a reflector to bounce some light onto the face and eliminate some of those shadows.  Overall: Nice expression. Great snapshot of a beautiful Spring day.', '2015-04-21 00:08:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7344057, 1147249, 180366, '<td valign="top">What I like:<br/>- This photo made me chuckle when it popped up. LOVE the subject and the framing<br/> <br/>What I don''t like:<br/>- The focus, it is too bad that the other bug (besides the fly) and the spiderweb are out of focus<br/> <br/>Overall: Would be a stronger picture if building in background were not in frame when shooting, allowing f stop to be increased for wider DOF and more of the web/ other bug in focus. Or, based on the title of the photo, same framing but slightly wider DOF</td>', 'What I like:- This photo made me chuckle when it popped up. LOVE the subject and the framing What I don''t like:- The focus, it is too bad that the other bug (besides the fly) and the spiderweb are out of focus Overall: Would be a stronger picture if building in background were not in frame when shooting, allowing f stop to be increased for wider DOF and more of the web/ other bug in focus. Or, based on the title of the photo, same framing but slightly wider DOF', '2015-04-21 00:11:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7344058, 1147547, 180366, '<td valign="top">What I like:<br/>- Umm.... a lot! the color, the subject, the take on the challenge subject<br/> <br/>What I don''t like:<br/>- bottom left corner there is a strange lens aberration/ flare (no idea what to call it) but that''s all I''ve got!<br/> <br/>Overall: amazing shot of a city. Can''t wait to see where this was taken. <br/> <br/>Okay: one more love: LOVE that there are no people to be seen; very dystopic and moody.</td>', 'What I like:- Umm.... a lot! the color, the subject, the take on the challenge subject What I don''t like:- bottom left corner there is a strange lens aberration/ flare (no idea what to call it) but that''s all I''ve got! Overall: amazing shot of a city. Can''t wait to see where this was taken.  Okay: one more love: LOVE that there are no people to be seen; very dystopic and moody.', '2015-04-21 00:14:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7344059, 1147467, 180366, '<td valign="top">What I like:<br/>- The awesome background and framing<br/> <br/>What I don''t like<br/>- Water drops take away from the awesome swoosh of the plant, breaking the flow for me.<br/> <br/>Overall: Love this shot save for the water droplets. I may have tried to remove most of them save for the one on the very tip as the surprise at the end of the curve (as my eyes followed the curve and it would literally be like a period- as it there were too many punctuation points before it.</td>', 'What I like:- The awesome background and framing What I don''t like- Water drops take away from the awesome swoosh of the plant, breaking the flow for me. Overall: Love this shot save for the water droplets. I may have tried to remove most of them save for the one on the very tip as the surprise at the end of the curve (as my eyes followed the curve and it would literally be like a period- as it there were too many punctuation points before it.', '2015-04-21 00:16:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7344060, 1147516, 180366, '<td valign="top">What I like:<br/>- That smile: beautiful<br/>- the posing of both the man, woman and the birds too, who am I kidding. The framing and subjects are well placed.<br/> <br/>What I don''t like:<br/>- colors are a bit too saturated. I think this picture would have more punch with more dark tones, too.<br/> <br/>Overall: great shot, but color is off</td>', 'What I like:- That smile: beautiful- the posing of both the man, woman and the birds too, who am I kidding. The framing and subjects are well placed. What I don''t like:- colors are a bit too saturated. I think this picture would have more punch with more dark tones, too. Overall: great shot, but color is off', '2015-04-21 00:18:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7344061, 1147544, 180366, '<td valign="top">What I like:<br/>- Spin on lawn theme. My yard, too, is rocks rather than grass<br/>- The rock looks almost alive, like some strange animal up on that platform with the plant appearing to grow out of it<br/> <br/>What I don''t like: <br/>- No real complaints<br/> <br/>Overall: quirky and fun shot. Not something I''d hang on my wall, but great take on the theme.</td>', 'What I like:- Spin on lawn theme. My yard, too, is rocks rather than grass- The rock looks almost alive, like some strange animal up on that platform with the plant appearing to grow out of it What I don''t like: - No real complaints Overall: quirky and fun shot. Not something I''d hang on my wall, but great take on the theme.', '2015-04-21 00:24:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7344062, 1147484, 180366, '<td valign="top">What I like:<br/>- Pose of the boy<br/>- Lovely angle with all that grass<br/> <br/>What I don''t like<br/>- Boy''s head is a bit too close to edge of the frame for my liking<br/>- Saturation is a bit high to my eyes.<br/> <br/>Overall: I love the boy''s pose and that shadow but wish it was zoomed out just a bit to give his head more clearance.</td>', 'What I like:- Pose of the boy- Lovely angle with all that grass What I don''t like- Boy''s head is a bit too close to edge of the frame for my liking- Saturation is a bit high to my eyes. Overall: I love the boy''s pose and that shadow but wish it was zoomed out just a bit to give his head more clearance.', '2015-04-21 00:25:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7344063, 1147062, 180366, '<td valign="top">What I like:<br/>- This effect goes great with the flower<br/> <br/>What I don''t like<br/>- this effect also bothers my motion sickness :/<br/> <br/>Overall: fun shot, but hard for me to look at secondary to my low threshold for motion sickness. This effect usually doesn''t make my stomach queasy. I think the color in this one may be lending to that effect. But I''m not docking any points off because of MY weak stomach, promise :)</td>', 'What I like:- This effect goes great with the flower What I don''t like- this effect also bothers my motion sickness :/ Overall: fun shot, but hard for me to look at secondary to my low threshold for motion sickness. This effect usually doesn''t make my stomach queasy. I think the color in this one may be lending to that effect. But I''m not docking any points off because of MY weak stomach, promise :)', '2015-04-21 00:27:48.000000', NULL, 1),
