(7344065, 1147231, 180366, '<td valign="top">What I like:<br/>- the colors in this picture and the archetecture are wild.<br/> <br/>What I don''t like:<br/>- While there is a lot of lawn in this photo, the people, fountains and the buildings steal the show. <br/> <br/>Overall: <br/>- There is a lot going on in this photo and it''s lack of focus distracts from the beauty of each individual thing.</td>', 'What I like:- the colors in this picture and the archetecture are wild. What I don''t like:- While there is a lot of lawn in this photo, the people, fountains and the buildings steal the show.  Overall: - There is a lot going on in this photo and it''s lack of focus distracts from the beauty of each individual thing.', '2015-04-21 00:31:40.000000', NULL, 1),
