(7344243, 1147227, 97225, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot - top shot. I love the bemused expression - he''s not going for it (is he not a fetcher?) and he''s not cringing, just a sort of ''what the heck is that'' look. 10</td>', 'Beautiful shot - top shot. I love the bemused expression - he''s not going for it (is he not a fetcher?) and he''s not cringing, just a sort of ''what the heck is that'' look. 10', '2015-04-21 21:55:57.000000', NULL, 1),
