(7344245, 1147548, 97225, '<td valign="top">Nice capture. It''s almost as though the grasshopper''s outlines have been drawn and the enclosed shapes simply left open to show the background colour. Top 5</td>', 'Nice capture. It''s almost as though the grasshopper''s outlines have been drawn and the enclosed shapes simply left open to show the background colour. Top 5', '2015-04-21 21:57:47.000000', NULL, 1),
