(7344405, 1147537, 103142, '<td valign="top">I''m glad that Lydia commented. When I was voting, I was stunned by this shot. What a bunch of work, and what wonderful idea! I loved the feet.<br/> <br/>But then I looked at it and I didn''t like the color cast. It seemed a tad underexposed. And the shot itself just didn''t do it for me. I gave it a 6, but I really, really wanted to give it a 9. The idea and pieces were sooooo excellent, but I really think it could have been a better photo, even with a color balance/exposure correction. Add some more processing to make it pop and bit more and it would have been truly spectacular.</td>', 'I''m glad that Lydia commented. When I was voting, I was stunned by this shot. What a bunch of work, and what wonderful idea! I loved the feet. But then I looked at it and I didn''t like the color cast. It seemed a tad underexposed. And the shot itself just didn''t do it for me. I gave it a 6, but I really, really wanted to give it a 9. The idea and pieces were sooooo excellent, but I really think it could have been a better photo, even with a color balance/exposure correction. Add some more processing to make it pop and bit more and it would have been truly spectacular.', '2015-04-22 14:56:57.000000', NULL, 0),
